{
  "name": "romaji-lyrics-extension",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Chrome 擴充功能:在 Spotify 網頁版的日文歌詞下方顯示羅馬拼音",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "rabbit EC site",
  "//repository": "這個網址會送給 LRCLIB 當來源識別,讓他們在出問題時能聯絡到開發者。改動時記得專案要真的存在。",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/psgo555/romaji-lyrics-extension"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node build.mjs",
    "watch": "node build.mjs --watch",
    "check:imports": "node tools/check-imports.mjs src",
    "icons": "node tools/make-icons.mjs",
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.js",
    "_comment_demo": "以下三支是目視用的示範腳本,不是測試 —— 它們只把結果印出來、沒有任何斷言,讀音轉錯也一樣 exit 0。真正的驗證在 npm test。",
    "demo:kana": "node legacy/test.cjs",
    "demo:kanji": "node legacy/test-kanji.cjs",
    "demo:corrections": "node legacy/test-corrections.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "kuroshiro": "^1.2.0",
    "kuroshiro-analyzer-kuromoji": "^1.1.0",
    "wanakana": "^5.3.1"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "esbuild": "^0.25.0",
    "path-browserify": "^1.0.1"
  }
}
